            <ArticleTitle>[Gastrobronchial fistula post sleeve gastrectomy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>157-61</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 35 years old female with morbid obesity IMC 45 was referred because of a gastrobronchial fistula developed post sleeve gastrectomy initially treated with endoscopic techniques without improvement, reason why a total resection of the gastric remanent with a Roux en Y reconstruction was done as an option with successful result.</AbstractText>
